          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q4. What is the length of the blue line and black line shown below? The distance between 0 and 1 is 1 unit long, and it is divided into two equal parts. The length of each part",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " So the blue line is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "units long. Write the fraction that gives the length of the black line in the box.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
